Hypothesis HYP-2185:
  Infinite Go supplies the open-game analogue of the repo n->n+2 boundary recursion.
  The shared invariant is a partition function with a retained boundary/coimage state.
  The equality boundary_tiles = 2n-1 ties THM-291 to the LRC floor resonance C=2n-1.
  Extra liberties beyond the two terminal liberties are serial fuel cells, omega*n.
